@startuml D11_ibd_logical
!include _style.iuml
title D11 Item flows between logical blocks (IBD)
component DatasetLoader
component FairValueService
component FeedParser
component OrderTable
component PriceLadder
component BboTracker
component Strategy
component RiskGate
component OrderEncoder
component Telemetry
component ConfigManager
component SessionController
component ResultWriter
DatasetLoader --> FeedParser : msg stream (A/X/E/M/S/V/H)
FairValueService --> FeedParser : V (fv, edge) in-band
FeedParser --> OrderTable : add / delete / execute / reduce
OrderTable --> PriceLadder : (level, side, +/- qty)
PriceLadder --> BboTracker : bitmaps, level qty
BboTracker --> Strategy : BBO (px, qty)
Strategy --> RiskGate : candidate (side, px, qty)
RiskGate --> OrderEncoder : accepted / reject reason
OrderEncoder --> ResultWriter : O / R / Z records
BboTracker --> ResultWriter : B records (debug)
ConfigManager --> Strategy : strat_en, kill
ConfigManager --> RiskGate : limits
FeedParser --> Telemetry : counters
RiskGate --> Telemetry : positions
SessionController --> ConfigManager : apply config
SessionController --> DatasetLoader : load
Telemetry --> SessionController : counters
@enduml
